*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0051
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-02-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-10-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 595
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0051.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> CHANNEL O=ONLINE B=BRANCH A=ATM
    05 CH-CD              PIC X.
    *> CARD PRESENT Y/N
    05 CP-FLG             PIC X.
       88 CP-NOT-PRESENT VALUE 'N'.
    *> TRANSACTION AMOUNT
    05 TA-AMT             PIC 9(7)V99.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 H-IN               PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> MANUAL REVIEW FLAG
    05 R-IND              PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 R-REVIEW-NEEDED VALUE 'Y'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM CHECK-CHANNEL
    DISPLAY "H-IN=" H-IN
    DISPLAY "R-IND=" R-IND
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-CHANNEL.
    IF CH-CD = 'O'
        IF CP-NOT-PRESENT AND TA-AMT GREATER THAN 1750
            MOVE 'Y' TO H-IN
            MOVE 'Y' TO R-IND
        *> LARGE ONLINE TRANSACTION - LIMIT 6250 PER 1998 POLICY
        ELSE IF TA-AMT GREATER THAN 12500
            SET R-REVIEW-NEEDED TO TRUE
        END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
